   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "Skull Knight",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Aw, man, they got me good!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "Return face to default",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "???",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "...Did you know?@Something interesting has appeared on Earth again.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "Kinaha",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "Oh? What sort of thing?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Something like a bioweapon,@with impressive proliferation and regeneration.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Go to the Earth Sphere and see whether@it could make good business.@Oh, and I'll be choosing where you go.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Where would that be?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Nihon, right in the <Steel Dragons>' backyard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Iradoya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "You've got history with them, haven't you, Kinaha?@You blundered right into them on a transition route@just the other day.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "...Once again, I deeply apologize for that matter.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Thanks to that, Iradoya had to put on a show so the@Steel Dragons wouldn't find out about our ties...@and I had to make apologies too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "(Must I still be blamed for this...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Oh? Unhappy about something?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "N-No, not at all...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Right?@After all, it was the great Gomoudokka who saved@you from a life sentence, Kinaha.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "...I'm well aware.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Gomoudokka",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Now then, get on with your next job.@There's an advance team near Nihon, isn't there?@Join up with them and give them a nudge.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Tell them I'm eager to see@the other \"Siebe Drive\" soon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Understood, Gomoudokka.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Earth Federation Army Far East Command, Izu Base",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Hagane - Commander's Office",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Daniel",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Sorry to keep you waiting, Brigadier General Miles.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Not at all... Is the situation at the General@Staff serious as well?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "This will be touched on in President Harold@Mellinger's state of emergency declaration,@to be broadcast shortly, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "With the lockdown of Paris, we abandoned our HQ.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "W-Was the unknowns' advance@that fierce...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "More precisely, we couldn't cope with their endless@reappearance. The City of Light has literally@become a ghost town.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "We've moved to a temporary HQ and are drawing up@operations to wipe out the Lamaris in each city,@Paris included.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Lamaris... Is that the unknowns' code name?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Yes. From today on, that's what we'll call them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "If it's proven that only the Steel Dragons can@fully eliminate the Lamaris, your unit will play@an important role in future operations.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Yes, sir. We'd welcome it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Also, Envoy Mekibos Borquede@has made an offer...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "On the condition that it's used on the Hagane,@the Zovorg will provide another@spatial transfer device.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "That's very welcome news...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "It will reach Izu shortly. Until then, the Steel@Dragons are under Far East Army command; join@the operation Major General Laker proposed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Then we'll head to Osaka as soon as maintenance@on the Hiryu Custom's spatial transfer device@is finished.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "That's too late.@Get ready quickly and sortie with the Hagane.@Wipe out the Lamaris with all current forces.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "All forces... Does that include the Kurogane@and the <Re-Tech> mobile weapons?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Naturally.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "So any piece that's useful gets used,@whatever its background?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "For as long as it's useful. Such is the will@of His Excellency, Marshal Gaspar.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "...Sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "One last thing. I have another order...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Hagane - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Radha, the Excellence Rescue@is loaded aboard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Good work. That's all the outside units loaded.@I'll report to Major Kai myself.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Please.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "As for your cabin assignments, I kept them the same@as during the Sealing War.@Please let Fiona and the others know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Um, excuse me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "What is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Have you seen Jinpu?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "No, he doesn't seem to be around here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "I see. Where'd he go...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Jinpu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "...Jeez, this is uncomfortable.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Weren't you told why you were called here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Yeah, pretty much.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "(Why would I get called in where all the@captains and squad leaders are gathered...?@Could it be...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "...Is everyone here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Yes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Then let's begin. As you all already know,@those unknowns... code name Lamaris...@have appeared in major cities around the world.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Their origin is still unknown... They've settled@into each city, multiplying and fighting the regional@armies' mobile units in a back-and-forth struggle.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "We too have been given a mission to wipe out the@Lamaris, and our forces have been bolstered@to make sure we accomplish it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "However, a few of those units were@assigned here for other reasons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "First, Granteed and Bellzelute. Their role@is to draw the attention of the enemy force@that has the <Thorn> to our unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "(In other words, bait...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Next... this is classified,@and not part of the reinforcements, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "A winged aircraft, apparently Gadisword's, that fell@near a <Mogami Heavy Industries> offshore plant@and was recovered, code-named \"Drift Wing\"...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "...along with its pilot, \"Sleeping Beauty,\"@has been secretly brought aboard the Hagane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "So that means...@there's someone from Gadisword aboard the Hagane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "And what exactly is this Gadisword...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Put simply, a new alien race. A failed transfer by@their giant space fortress, the Rabulpaila, flung@them from their home world into the solar system.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "(So the boss and I guessed right@that Sleeping Beauty's an alien...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Has that been verified?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Yes. When we went to <Rabulpaila>, Gadisword@asked us to search for a deserter@named Fairy Klibia.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "The data they gave us matched Sleeping Beauty.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Why did Fairy Klibia desert the Rabulpaila@and come to Earth?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Gadisword doesn't know. And neither do we.@Because she has lost most of her memory.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "But that doesn't mean we have no leads.@The Drift Wing is very likely@some kind of experimental craft, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Gadisword provided no information@about it whatsoever.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Sounds like something's going on behind the scenes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "The Joint Chiefs think so too. Gadisword asked us@to find and hand over the Drift Wing and@Fairy Klibia, and yet...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "...they may also have tried@to retake them by force.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "But the guys who hit our offshore plant@were usin' Zovorg units, y'know?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "From that, we can infer that Gadisword and@the Golaikunru, the Zovorg war merchants,@are working together behind the scenes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Then the guys who attacked us@when we went to the Rabulpaila...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "So it was an act, to keep anyone from catching@on to the Golaikunru-Gadisword connection.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Probably.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Then what happens to Sleeping Beauty?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "We won't hand Fairy Klibia over as demanded.@We'll try to restore as much of her memory@as possible and draw information from her.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "And the key to that is@Akimi Akatsuki and Akemi Akatsuki.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "...! Could this have something to do with that...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "What's that supposed to mean?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "The other day, the Akatsuki siblings ran into@Fairy Klibia by chance on the base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "She's currently posing as someone with@<Mogami Heavy Industries>, so those two@haven't realized who she is, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "When Fairy saw Akimi,@she showed signs of regaining her memory.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Specifically, how so?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "On seeing Akimi, she reflexively blurted out the name@of someone she knew. Although she still@can't remember who that is.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "We could use truth serum to force information out of@Fairy Klibia, but the Earth Federation Government@and Gadisword are negotiating a friendship treaty.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "The search for Fairy was requested directly by their@representative, so to reduce the chance of@problems arising down the line...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Our unit will try to restore@her memory peacefully.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Even so, puttin' Sleeping Beauty on a ship@that's about to fight the Lamaris@is dangerous, ain't it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "A fair point. However, the Joint Chiefs judged@that our unit, with its great strength and@high mobility...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "...is the most fitting place to ensure the safety@of Fairy Klibia and the Drift Wing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "...More like it makes the perfect decoy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Did you say something?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "No, nothing, sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "So what're you plannin' to have@Akimi and Akemi do?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "I'll brief you on that later.@The Drift Wing's existence and Fairy Klibia's@identity are top secret.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Except for Major Tetsuya Onodera, Major Sean Webley@and Dr. Eric Wang, you are not to speak of this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "...Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "We sortie for the Osaka area at 1400, when@loading is complete. All ships and units, make@thorough launch preparations.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Space Beyond Lunar Orbit",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Zeranio-class Carrier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Zeranio-class Carrier - Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Bilgo",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "I thank you for visiting my ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "...Calling the Zeranio-class that the <Golaikunru>@lent you \"my ship\"... How full of yourself.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "Let me make one thing clear:@we are not your servants.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Well, fine. You've received your orders, yes?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Yes, we've been told to support your mission.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Good. Then we'll conduct a reconnaissance in force@on the unknowns in the city called Osaka.@Prepare for spatial transfer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "Bioroid Soldier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "All units have transferred to the target coordinates.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "Then begin the reconnaissance in force.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "Spatial distortion detected above.@Caution. Caution.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "What did you say...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "Undersea, Off the Coast of Japan",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "What's happening?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "All the recon team's bioroids are out of control...!@They won't accept our commands.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "A bug? Or a virus?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "With protections and isolation mode in place,@all of them being infected at once is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "Can't you reboot them? Make them self-destruct?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "...As I said, they're out of control.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "(That spatial distortion just before...@Could it be connected to the unknowns...?!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Japan - Near Mount Ikoma",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Steel Dragons",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "Hagane: Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "Radar contact!@Unknowns approaching straight from 11 o'clock!@Range 4!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "Could it be the Lamaris?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "Identified... Zovorg mobile weapons!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Blast it, just when we need to hurry to Osaka...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "Shall we intercept? Or go around?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "Even if we shake them off here,@they might attack somewhere else...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "This ship will go ahead to Osaka. Have the Hiryu@Custom intercept. Destroy them before they@reach populated areas.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "Enemy group entering range 3!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "All mobile units, sortie immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "Kota, those units' bioroids seem to be@controlled by those things.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "You mean <That Amoeba Guy>?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "Right. Let the others know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "Yeah, got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "Major Kai, those guys are bein' controlled by the@amoeba bastards. They might be after@the Compati Kaiser.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "Understood. Eleve 1 to all units,@the enemy is possessed.@Avoid close combat.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "XO, this ship will go ahead to Osaka.@Leave the combat area within 300 seconds.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "Roger. Starboard 90! Both engines,@third battle speed ahead!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "What the? Some of 'em are headin' for Osaka.@Ain't they after the Compati Kaiser?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "Could they be after the Hagane...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "Maybe, but why?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "The ones we ran into in space went after@pretty much everybody, though.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "We never did figure out why@they attacked us back then...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "Whatever the reason, we can't overlook this.@Eleve 1 to all units!@Don't let the enemy near the Hagane!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "XO, leave the combat area within 120 seconds.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "Roger! Hold course, both engines,@fourth battle speed!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "XO, leave the combat area within 60 seconds.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "Roger! Hold course, both engines,@maximum battle speed!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "Ngh! We couldn't get clear in time!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "Eun",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "Remaining enemies wiped out! No enemies in the vicinity!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "Recover all units at once! We're heading to Osaka too!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "...Feels like their goal was just@to hold us up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "Even you think so?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "Yeah... Hey, wait, you just slipped@an insult in there, didn't you?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "That's not what I meant...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "(A reason to hold us up here...@To keep us from getting to Osaka?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "Remaining enemies wiped out! No enemies in the area!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "You destroyed the enemy before this ship got clear.@Hmph, I'll grant you that's impressive.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "Then the unit will now hurry to Osaka.@Is that acceptable?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "Mm.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  }
 ]
}